    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d446-a3">

                <pb facs="0826" n="716" sameAs="frus:frus1890/pg716"/>

                <opener><seg rendition="#center">[Inclosure 3 in No.
                    82.—Translation.]</seg></opener>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Governor Malmboeg to
                        Mr Thomas.</hi></head>
                <opener><dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Filipstad</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1890-09-15"><hi rendition="#italic">September</hi> 15,
                        1890</date>.</dateline></opener>
                <p>In John Ericsson’s native province, the Swedish men present at his burial have,
                    at a banquet immediately following, drank the health of the Chief of State of
                    that land which witnessed the triumph of Ericsson’s greatest achievement, which
                    toast they request will be forwarded by you to the President.</p>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">Adolf Malmboeg</hi>,<lb/><hi
                            rendition="#italic">Governor of the Province of
                    Wermland.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
